{"id":"steam-731340","steam":731340,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"EscapeNET","summary":"Survive in first person, deadly AI-controlled chambers in EscapeNET, where players must cooperate as humans and drones, solve deadly puzzles, and face off in high-stakes PvP arenas — all under relentless time pressure.","about":"THE NARRATIVE:\n\nWelcome to EscapeNET. Humanity has fallen. AI rules. And you are its experiment. The AI watches, and adapts — every mistake fuels its knowledge.\n\nGAMEPLAY:\n\nEscapeNET is a multiplayer co-op light horror experience where 2–4 players are thrown into a network of deadly chambers designed to test every aspect of human skill, puzzle solving, strategy, and survival. Survive deadly puzzles, navigate unseen dangers with drone-assisted teammates, and compete against your friends in high-stakes arenas — all while racing against time. \n\nOne wrong move can mean instant deletion. \n\nYou can’t hide from the code.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731340/01a984b5a7a9c908ca584a216bbabf13f8fe4e0f/library_capsule.jpg?t=1793114022","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731340/42baf1a34b5d100ac5da0de25b8ebd5065e93b23/header.jpg?t=1793114022","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731340/c7a485ff4404e9c62f27f32fecb1141b3234cb02/library_hero.jpg?t=1793114022","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731340/42baf1a34b5d100ac5da0de25b8ebd5065e93b23/header.jpg?t=1793114022","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731340/2f548e6816b5606f9959ecb2e9a7edcdb683d836/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1793114022","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/731340/d6ba6acd5f83e6076b988495a425cf997c4a4546/ss_d6ba6acd5f83e6076b988495a425cf997c4a4546.600x338.jpg?t=1793114022","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item